    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_intro">Runs the cheese exploit (CVE-2025-21479, Adreno GPU) for a temporary root shell and loads KernelSU through ksud late-load. The offsets are computed from a kernel image on the device itself.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Credits</string>
    <string name="about_credits_body">Built on GhostLock by YuKongA (Apache-2.0) — the UI, build wiring and offset extractor started from that project. GhostLock in turn builds on NebuSec/CyberMeowfia, JoinChang/ghostlock-oneplus and x-spy/CVE-2026-43499-popsicle.</string>
    <string name="about_license">License</string>
    <string name="about_license_body">Apache License 2.0 — see LICENSE in the repository.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_body">For authorized security research on devices you own only. The offsets, KMI and exploit target one kernel/firmware family — running it anywhere else can brick the device. A temporary root stops working after a reboot.</string>
